00:46:16.900 --> 00:46:18.060
Right. It's pretty wild.

00:46:18.200 --> 00:46:29.940
There's actually no, there's no real way to see what they're supposed to do or to, there's no real way to even figure out that it's not working because there's, you buy a sword and there's no stats visible on that sword.

00:46:29.940 --> 00:46:34.040
