02:40:06.160 --> 02:40:13.360
But instead, I'm offering, when you have the opportunity to play Final Fantasy 16 and Final

02:40:13.360 --> 02:40:16.280
Fantasy 1, should you play both?

02:40:16.280 --> 02:40:20.300
Or should... Or do you get what you need out of Final Fantasy 16?

02:40:20.300 --> 02:40:26.820
And I think that's what makes Final Fantasy 1 so interesting to me, is that right here,

02:40:27.020 --> 02:40:32.600
in the very first entry in the series, which seems kind of obvious now in hindsight, like,

02:40:32.640 --> 02:40:38.420
of course, there would be 16 plus countless spinoffs if a franchise knocks it out of the

02:40:38.420 --> 02:40:40.220
park. But they really did here.

02:40:40.360 --> 02:40:42.420
They really did knock it out of the park.

02:40:43.120 --> 02:40:45.000
