02:41:08.540 --> 02:41:10.860
Or this stat doesn't mean anything.

02:41:10.860 --> 02:41:12.620
Like, those things do stink.

02:41:12.640 --> 02:41:15.360
But the game still completely works.

02:41:15.540 --> 02:41:17.360
It is playable. It is beatable.

02:41:17.560 --> 02:41:18.400
It is enjoyable.

02:41:18.900 --> 02:41:22.840
And I think when I'm talking about, like, are these games still playable today?

02:41:23.200 --> 02:41:24.720
Or still worth playing today?

02:41:24.960 --> 02:41:26.340
Sorry, still worth playing today?

02:41:26.820 --> 02:41:31.740
