02:43:43.160 --> 02:43:44.920
They all have their own things to offer.

02:43:45.700 --> 02:43:49.520
And looking at this in a vacuum, I mean, I don't think...

02:43:49.520 --> 02:43:54.440
If you can get past those quality of life things, I don't think anyone walks away from this disappointed.

02:43:54.980 --> 02:43:57.380
